WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
(reads the chat message about the CLI)

00:03.300 --> 00:08.300
I think that's cool, but I also think that the value of templates is going down,

00:08.300 --> 00:12.600
especially templates that are as specific as different languages and the way that you combine them.

00:12.700 --> 00:16.400
I think the value of that is going down rapidly,

00:16.400 --> 00:20.500
but it's a cool project to learn about a lot of things. Keep it up.
